# Frontend Rules

- All HTTP calls must go through `web/src/api/client.ts`. Do not create duplicate API clients.
- Prefer backend-provided authoritative values for invoice totals and derived data.
- Do not duplicate backend business calculations in the frontend.
- If frontend intentionally mirrors backend logic, add tests and document the reason.
